{
  "$Comment": "Mob Battle training dagger fighter's combat, laid out like CAE_MobBattle_Dummy_Knight but with the player's own iron dagger attacks. Basic attacks = Root_Weapon_Daggers_Primary (swing left, swing right, stab left, stab right). Pounce = Weapon_Daggers_Primary_Pounce straight away (the player's 0.2 s tap-or-hold charge is skipped), ChargeFor 0.4 = its highest charge key. Signature = Root_Weapon_Daggers_Signature_Razorstrike, only picked with full SignatureEnergy (held daggers raise its max to 27; hits fill it). Damage vars are the ones of Weapon_Daggers_Iron. Daggers are drawn in both hands from the main hand, so no off hand is set. Guard = Root_Weapon_Daggers_Secondary_Guard (the player's right click), raised after taking damage like the knight's shield. Kept distances: the role's MaintainDistance takes its range from each action's PostExecuteDistanceRange, so they all stay inside the basic attack's reach (strafe 2.5-4 kept it out of reach, staring at its rival); basic attack Timeout 0.5 lets it finish aiming instead of losing the try and waiting a cooldown.",
